  "bio": "Martin Holbech is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Aarhus C, Denmark, specializing in intricate black and gray styles. With a commendable professional background tattooing since 2012, Martin is known for delivering exceptional pieces at Iron & Ink, garnering respect and a steady clientele that appreciates his meticulous artistry and dedication to the craft.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Aarhus C, Central Denmark Region, Denmark\n\n✖️KBH @ironinktattoo.cph \n✖️Tattoing since 2012\n✖️Black’n Grey work\n✖️Sorry mom aftercare",
